flowchart LR
    POI[Workbook destinations] --> CATALOG[Information-only bundled catalogue]
    OSM[Bounded OSM source snapshot] --> CANDIDATE[Restriction-aware candidate extraction]
    CANDIDATE --> REVIEW[Required topology, access and entrance review]
    REVIEW --> RELEASE[Versioned region JSON and detached signature]
    RELEASE --> PICKER[Future Stitch screen: two SAF documents]
    PICKER --> KEY[Bundled publisher RSA trust root required]
    KEY --> VERIFY[Bounded stream, signature, region and schema validation]
    CATALOG --> VALIDATE[APK asset validation]
    VERIFY --> TX[Room transaction: immutable version and active pointer]
    VALIDATE --> TX
    TX --> KEEP[Retain pinned older versions]
    CANDIDATE -. not bundled or enabled .-> LIMIT[No invented building connectors]
